  184:  Add   *Var0  *GF_JAN07_SavedYoshi
  194:  Add   *Var0  *GF_JAN08_SavedYoshi
  1A4:  Add   *Var0  *GF_JAN10_SavedYoshi
  1B4:  Add   *Var0  *GF_JAN11_SavedYoshi
